`Causalean/Stat/CLT/MultivariateCLT.lean`, `Stat/Inference/WaldVec.lean`, and
`Stat/Inference/RatioDeltaMethod.lean`
state their limit laws against an *abstract* target measure `Q` together with the
hypothesis
