in the form of `GaussianMoments.integral_Ioi_id_gaussianReal`) — and the per-stratum algebra
`wMin·e + (wMax−wMin)·e/(Λ+1) = 1`, `(wMax−wMin)·e = (1−e)(Λ²−1)/Λ`, at the cutoff where
`(c−m)/σ = Φ⁻¹(Λ/(Λ+1))`. -/

