# Two-sided bounds on the tail integral

Bridges the layer-cake reduction (`tailIntegral = ∫_{(1,λ⁻¹]} P{U ≤ t⁻¹}`) to the
power integral `∫_{(t₀⁻¹,λ⁻¹]} t^{-κ}`.  Splitting at `t₀⁻¹`:

